WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:04.975
Install OpenFile on any device, from a phone to a Linux box.

2
00:00:06.475 --> 00:00:10.572
Web app, Windows, macOS, Linux, Android and iPhone: what each option gives

3
00:00:10.572 --> 00:00:14.283
you, how to install it, and which one I would pick for your device.

4
00:00:15.683 --> 00:00:19.937
Start with the check. The box below reads your browser's user agent and

5
00:00:19.937 --> 00:00:22.275
display mode and suggests the best fit.

6
00:00:23.575 --> 00:00:27.815
Option two: the desktop apps. Some people want a classic installer, or need

7
00:00:27.815 --> 00:00:31.489
the app on machines where browser installs are blocked by policy.

8
00:00:32.789 --> 00:00:34.417
What stays the same everywhere.

9
00:00:34.417 --> 00:00:38.144
Whichever option you choose, the code doing the work is the same build.

10
00:00:39.444 --> 00:00:44.097
Which one I use. On my laptop I use the installed web app from Chrome, because

11
00:00:44.097 --> 00:00:46.185
it updates the moment I push a fix.

12
00:00:47.485 --> 00:00:50.004
To try it, open PDF Reader in OpenFile.

13
00:00:50.004 --> 00:00:53.685
Drop in a file, adjust the settings and press the button.

14
00:00:53.685 --> 00:00:56.979
It all runs on your device, so nothing is uploaded.

15
00:01:00.585 --> 00:01:04.063
Read the full post, with live demos, on the OpenFile blog.
